sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Host as Host Player
    participant HostApp as Host Client (Game Hub)
    participant Relay as WebRTC Signaling (Clipboard / QR Code)
    participant GuestApp as Guest Client (Game Hub)
    actor Guest as Guest Player

    Host->>HostApp: Navigate to /multiplayer/create
    HostApp->>HostApp: Generate random 6-character room code (e.g. "GH-8X2Y")
    HostApp->>HostApp: Initialize RTCPeerConnection & Create DataChannel ("gamehub-data")
    HostApp->>HostApp: Generate WebRTC SDP Offer + ICE candidates
    HostApp-->>Host: Display Room Code, Share Link & QR Code
    Host->>Relay: Share Room Code or Invitation Link with Guest
    Relay-->>Guest: Guest receives Code / Link

    Guest->>GuestApp: Navigate to /multiplayer/join (or /join/GH-8X2Y)
    GuestApp->>GuestApp: Initialize RTCPeerConnection
    GuestApp->>GuestApp: Process Offer & Generate SDP Answer
    GuestApp->>Relay: Send Answer / Peer Handshake Token
    Relay-->>HostApp: Host accepts Peer Answer

    HostApp->>GuestApp: P2P DataChannel Established (State: 'OPEN')
    HostApp-->>Host: Status: Connected! Ready to select game
    GuestApp-->>Guest: Status: Connected! Waiting for Host to launch

    Host->>HostApp: Select Checkers & Click "Start Match"
    HostApp->>HostApp: Initialize authoritative CheckersEngine
    HostApp->>GuestApp: Send DATA: { type: 'START_GAME', game: 'checkers', state: {...} }
    HostApp-->>Host: Render Checkers Board (Player 1: Red)
    GuestApp-->>Guest: Render Checkers Board (Player 2: Black)

    loop Turn-Based Match
        Guest->>GuestApp: Click piece to move (from: [2,1], to: [3,2])
        GuestApp->>HostApp: Send DATA: { type: 'MAKE_MOVE', move: {...}, playerId: 'guest' }
        HostApp->>HostApp: Authoritative Validation with CheckersEngine.applyMove()
        alt Move is Valid
            HostApp->>HostApp: Update Host GameState
            HostApp->>GuestApp: Broadcast DATA: { type: 'SYNC_STATE', state: nextState }
            HostApp-->>Host: Update UI
            GuestApp-->>Guest: Update UI
        else Move is Invalid / Out-of-turn
            HostApp->>GuestApp: Send DATA: { type: 'MOVE_REJECTED', reason: 'Invalid turn' }
        end
    end

    HostApp->>HostApp: Check win condition (all opponent pieces captured)
    HostApp->>GuestApp: Broadcast DATA: { type: 'GAME_OVER', winner: 'guest', score: {...} }
    HostApp-->>Host: Show Match Summary & Rematch button
    GuestApp-->>Guest: Show Match Summary & Rematch button
